# Choose one of the dedicated example files instead of editing this mixed file.
#
# Development:
#   cp .env.development.example .env
#   Leave DISCORD_BOT_TOKEN empty if production is already running the live bot.
#   Set DISCORD_APPLICATION_PUBLIC_KEY to validate Discord webhook events.
#
# Production:
#   cp .env.production.example .env
#   Set DISCORD_BOT_TOKEN only in the environment that should own the live bot connection.
#   Set DISCORD_APPLICATION_PUBLIC_KEY to validate Discord webhook events.
